      "body": "\nCONCERN:\n\n[RFC9936] \"*** BROKEN REFERENCE ***\".\n\n\nMINOR:\n\nIn Section 5 and the ASN.1 Module:\n\nComposite-MLKEM-CMS-2026\n   { iso(1) identified-organization(3) dod(6) internet(1)\n   security(5) mechanisms(5) pkix(7) id-mod(0)\n   id-mod-composite-mlkem-cms-2026(TBDMOD) }\n\nWe usually assign CMS-related module identifiers from the S/MIME arc.\n\n\nNIT:\n\nSection 2.1: s/wrap:/wrap/\n\n\nASN.1 CHECK:\n\nWith placeholder values for the module identifiers, the ASN.1 module compiles without error.\n\nRuss",
